{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_3906bc0812794866bc40e7c8","type":"tool_result","content":"70\t/** What the connector needs from the host to run a session. Every dependency\n71\t *  has a working production default; the overrides exist for test isolation\n72\t *  (temp registry/thread, scripted launch/selection) and for Stories 5/6 to swap\n73\t *  in the PI-auth-backed inference config.\n74\t *\n75\t *  `buildSdkConfig` returns the SdkConfig the instance is constructed from. Its\n76\t *  default is the observe-only config below (a real, construction-valid SDK);\n77\t *  Stories 5/6 inject the PI-model-registry-backed `ModelCall` + assignments. */\n78\texport interface ConnectorDeps {\n79\t  buildSdkConfig?: (ctx: ExtensionContext) => OpResult<SdkConfig>;\n80\t  registryPath?: string;\n81\t  newThreadFilePath?: () => string;\n82\t  parseLaunch?: () => LaunchFlags;\n83\t  selectThread?: (\n84\t    choices: readonly ThreadChoice[],\n85\t    ctx: ExtensionContext,\n86\t  ) => Promise<string | null>;\n87\t}\n88\t\n89\t/** Everything the connector retains across hooks as PLAIN data — by"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7894f3ec-841a-4c17-b9cf-403440004aac","uuid":"5707fb2d-db18-4fc9-9ba4-8e1f168312e0","timestamp":"2026-06-14T12:40:31.324Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts","content":"/** What the connector needs from the host to run a session. Every dependency\n *  has a working production default; the overrides exist for test isolation\n *  (temp registry/thread, scripted launch/selection) and for Stories 5/6 to swap\n *  in the PI-auth-backed inference config.\n *\n *  `buildSdkConfig` returns the SdkConfig the instance is constructed from. Its\n *  default is the observe-only config below (a real, construction-valid SDK);\n *  Stories 5/6 inject the PI-model-registry-backed `ModelCall` + assignments. */\nexport interfa